      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Green Ana Glena is a wonderful 3 bed, detached family home on c. 0.5 acres of beautiful gardens, located in the picturesque village of Ashford. This delightful property is nestled into the hillside on a beautiful mature site within walking distance of the village and all local amenities.\r\n\r\nThis fine family home is situated in the highly sought-after location of Ballinahinch, a short stroll from the centre of Ashford village and all its amenities. Built in the late 1930s this bespoke property extends to c.170 Sq Meters (1829 Sq Ft). Whilst it would undoubtedly benefit from modernisation and renovation, Green Ana Glena simply oozes the potential to be a stunning and substantial family home in a wonderful location. \r\n\r\nAccommodation on the ground floor comprises of an entrance porch and hallway, sitting room, living room, family room, dining room, conservatory which links into the kitchen and two WC’s. Upstairs there are three light filled bedrooms with timber floors and a family bathroom. The rooms throughout the house are generously proportioned and are designed to take advantage of the wonderful aspect overlooking the beautiful gardens. There is ample space to extend to the rear or to the side subject to relevant planning permissions.\r\n\r\nThe property is freehold, has electric storage heaters, mains water and mains sewerage. There is a  gravelled parking area to the front & side of the house, with parking for several vehicles. The wonderful, gardens make the most of the incredible site with mature shrubs, specimen trees including a stunning copper beech at the entrance gate  and a private South facing patio area that could be perfect for entertaining. \r\n\r\nGreen Ana Glena is within walking distance to the village centre and all local amenities. The renowned Avoca Cafe and shops at Mount Usher are a short stroll away. The Ashford area is famous for the surrounding countryside with award winning beaches and wonderful forest walks and the majestic Wicklow Mountains just a stone's throw away. There are excellent schools, shops, pubs and restaurants in the immediate vicinity. Ashford has become a haven for the commuter and one of the most sought after residential areas of Co. Wicklow. Dart services are available from Greystones and the M11 roadway means South Dublin and the M50 are only 25 minutes away. Frequent direct bus services are also available from the village. \r\n\r\nProperties in the centre of Ashford Village don't come up that often. When they do they are generally snapped up and quickly. The sale of Green Ana Glena represents a rare opportunity to acquire a potentially wonderful family home in one of the most sought after areas in County Wicklow.\r\nUnique properties like Green Ana Glena come along once in a lifetime and this a fantastic opportunity to acquire a wonderful family home in one of the most beautiful locations in County Wicklow.\r\n\r\nBER G Ref: 119380541"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb family home in the highly sought after location of Ashford village.\r\nSituated in the centre of beautiful Ashford and close to all local amenities.\r\nExtends to approximately c.170 Sq Metres (1829 Sq Ft).\r\nOozes the potential to be a stunning and substantial family home in a wonderful location.\r\nWonderfully private and bounded by mature native trees.\r\nSouth facing patio area that could be perfect for entertaining.\r\nIncredible site with mature shrubs, specimen trees including a stunning copper beech\r\nThere is ample space to extend to the rear or to the side subject to relevant planning permissions.\r\nLife in Ashford ensures a great blend of easy access to Dublin city and charming country living.\r\nSouth Dublin and the M50 are only 25 minutes away."
      },
      {
